// Safe expression evaluator (no eval / new Function)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Supported grammar (recursive-descent parser):
//
//   expr        → or_expr
//   or_expr     → and_expr  ( '||' and_expr )*
//   and_expr    → not_expr  ( '&&' not_expr )*
//   not_expr    → '!' not_expr  |  cmp_expr
//   cmp_expr    → add_expr  ( ( '==' | '!=' | '<=' | '>=' | '<' | '>' ) add_expr )*
//   add_expr    → mul_expr  ( ( '+' | '-' ) mul_expr )*
//   mul_expr    → unary     ( ( '*' | '/' | '%' ) unary )*
//   unary       → '-' unary |  primary
//   primary     → NUMBER | STRING | BOOLEAN | NULL | UNDEFINED
//               | IDENTIFIER ( '.' IDENTIFIER )* ( '[' expr ']' ( '.' IDENTIFIER )* )*
//               | '(' expr ')'
//
// Context variables are resolved against the `context` object supplied in the
// request body.  Only plain property access is allowed — no function calls.

