 * Tokenise an expression string into an array of token objects.
 * Each token: { type, value }
 * Types: NUMBER, STRING, BOOL, NULL, UNDEFINED, IDENT, OP, LPAREN, RPAREN, LBRACKET, RBRACKET, DOT
 */
